  "title": "Soukyuu no Fafner",
  "justification": "The row sending AniDB specials S3 \"Episode 1 Opening\" and S4 \"Episode 26 Opening\" to TVDB season 1 episodes 25 \"Symbiosis (The Final Battle)\" and 26 \"The Sky (Azure)\" is removed: creditless openings are not episodes, and both are unmapped. S5-S9 (the episode 15, 23, 24, 25 and 25/26 endings) fell on season 0 episodes 5-8, the Exodus items \"EXODUS #01\", \"EXODUS #22\" and \"BEHIND THE LINE\", and are unmapped. AniDB lists 25 regular episodes and its episode 25 \"The Sky (Azure) / Sora\" (2004-12-27) is the double finale: AniDB's own specials \"Episode 25 Symbiosis (The Final Battle) Ending\" and \"Episode 25/26 The Sky (Azure) Ending\" place both halves in it. TVDB splits it into season 1 episodes 25 \"Symbiosis (The Final Battle)\" and 26 \"The Sky (Azure)\", both 2004-12-26, so episode 25 maps to both. S1 and S2 stay on \"Arcadian Memory 1\" and \"2\".",
